(Oceanic Maritime Logistics - Conduct, Remote Work, and Travel Regulations) '
(Document Ref: OML-HR-POL-03 | Classification: Internal) '
(Section 1: Remote Work Policy) '
(Remote work eligibility: Eligible full-time office staff may work remotely up to 2 days per week \(Tuesdays and Thursdays\).) '
(Remote work core hours: Remote personnel must remain online and available during core hours of 10:00 to 15:00 local time.) '
(Home office technical allowance: One-time IT hardware provision of $400 for dual monitor or dock setup upon hire.) '
(Resignation notice period: Standard staff must provide 30 calendar days written notice; Department Directors must provide 60 calendar days.) '
(Anti-harassment reporting: Formal workplace harassment grievances must be filed with HR in writing within 45 days of occurrence.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
